msgid "OpenVR"
msgstr "OpenVR"

msgid ""
"OpenVR is the original API Valve created to interface with SteamVR. Support "
"for this API is offered through the `Godot OpenVR plugin. <https://"
"github.com/godotvr/godot_openvr>`__"
msgstr ""
"OpenVR 是 Valve 公司為與 SteamVR 進行互動而開發的原始 API。該 API 的支援通過 "
"`Godot OpenVR plugin. <https://github.com/godotvr/godot_openvr>`__ 提供"

msgid ""
"For any new XR project we highly recommend using Godot's built-in OpenXR "
"support. The OpenVR plugin can be applicable for some niche use cases such "
"as creating OpenVR Overlays."
msgstr ""
"對於任何新的 XR 專案，我們強烈建議使用 Godot 內建的 OpenXR 支援。OpenVR 外掛"
"適用於某些特定場景，例如建立 OpenVR 疊加層。"

msgid ""
"For more information, please consult the documentation provided with the "
"plugin."
msgstr "如需瞭解更多資訊，請參閱隨外掛提供的文件。"

msgid ""
"This plugin is **not** maintained by the Godot Foundation. A few intrepid "
"contributors ensure occasional maintenance releases of the plugin as needed."
msgstr ""
"本外掛 **並非** 由 Godot 基金會維護。少數勇敢的貢獻者會根據需要不定期為該外掛"
"發佈維護版本。"
